<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Are you okay!? Do you know who I am?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl with short hair was shouting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, thank goodness...! Really, thank goodness!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
