{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> was there too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where am I?<PG>
I have a feeling I was dreaming just now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wandering on and on, alone, through some place I didn't know...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I was talking with someone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... I can't remember who it was.<PG>
I clearly remember the two of them calling me back.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You were holding my hand the whole time, weren't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You were calling me, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah! I held your hand, and I called out to you too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
