{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Uuu! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came back to life!"</STYLE><PG>
That's right. Even after taking an attack like that, I'm alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wound on <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s forehead was still raw, so no more than a few hours could have passed since then.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... what happened after that?</STYLE>
