{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>Kotaro-san</STYLE> had fallen to the ground and was pinned down by the tree's roots, most of them cut short. He couldn't move at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The timing was far too good for a coincidence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, this place was prone to cave-ins to begin with, and then there was that shaking just now.
