<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then let's go again over summer vacation or something! </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'ll probably be leaving to study abroad around then, so it'll double as her farewell party. I bet </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'ll be happy too!</STYLE>
